From bcd9e9a34f4731a00e0141127f5951093a78e534 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Till Heinzerling <1684934+hoinzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:06:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] virtual-media: update for current sdbusplus and Boost.Asio

Current sdbusplus headers require C++23 for std::move_only_function,
while current Boost.Asio removed expires_from_now and defaults spawn to
a deferred completion token. Build as C++23, use expires_after, and
explicitly detach the long-running coroutines. Expose the CRTP event
overload so current GCC does not reject the archived state classes with
-Werror=overloaded-virtual.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Till Heinzerling <1684934+hoinzy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 meson.build                      |  8 ++++----
 src/state/activating_state.hpp   |  2 ++
 src/state/active_state.hpp       |  6 ++++--
 src/state/deactivating_state.hpp |  2 ++
 src/state/initial_state.hpp      |  2 ++
 src/state/ready_state.hpp        |  2 ++
 src/system.hpp                   | 11 ++++++-----
 src/utils.hpp                    |  2 +-
 8 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index ad24d31..d46ec1a 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -4,15 +4,15 @@ project(
     default_options: [
         'warning_level=3',
         'werror=true',
-        'cpp_std=c++20',
+        'cpp_std=c++23',
         'cpp_rtti=false',
     ],
     license: 'Apache-2.0',
     version: '0.1',
 )
 
-if get_option('cpp_std') != 'c++20'
-    error('This project requires c++20 support')
+if get_option('cpp_std') != 'c++23'
+    error('This project requires c++23 support')
 endif
 
 cxx = meson.get_compiler('cpp')
@@ -158,7 +158,7 @@ if not sdbusplus.found()
 endif
 
 boost = dependency('boost',
-                   modules: ['coroutine', 'iostreams', 'filesystem',
+                   modules: ['context', 'coroutine', 'iostreams', 'filesystem',
 			     'program_options', 'regex', 'system'],
                    version: '>=1.77',
                    fallback : ['boost', 'boost_dep'],
